---
component: postcard
effects: true
params:
  to: { domain: recipient }
  rank: { type: number, default: 10 }
beat:
  on: placeVisit
  target: place.post
  title: "A postcard"
  priority: "@rank"
  once: day
  share: postcardDay
  after: "visited('post.mira.meet')"
  when: "holds(present(mira, post)) && run.machineFixed && !holds(sentTo(@to))"
---

## A postcard

@narrator: Mira slides the rack round. Gulls, the lighthouse, the lighthouse again with a gull on it.
@sol{mono}: One for {{@to}}.
::body
::set{run.postcards += 1}
::assert{sentTo(@to)}
::set{run.seen.mira = run.day}
@mira: {{@to}}. Lovely. It'll go with the afternoon van.
